.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt SSL_CONF_CTX_SET_SSL_CTX 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm SSL_CONF_CTX_finish ,
.Nm SSL_CONF_CTX_set_ssl_ctx ,
.Nm SSL_CONF_CTX_set_ssl
.Nd set context to configure
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/ssl.h
.Ft void
.Fo SSL_CONF_CTX_set_ssl_ctx
.Fa "SSL_CONF_CTX *cctx"
.Fa "SSL_CTX *ctx"
.Fc
.Ft void
.Fo SSL_CONF_CTX_set_ssl
.Fa "SSL_CONF_CTX *cctx"
.Fa "SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo SSL_CONF_CTX_finish
.Fa "SSL_CONF_CTX *cctx"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn SSL_CONF_CTX_set_ssl_ctx
sets the context associated with
.Fa cctx
to the
.Vt SSL_CTX
structure
.Fa ctx .
Any previous
.Vt SSL
or
.Vt SSL_CTX
associated with
.Fa cctx
is cleared.
Subsequent calls to
.Xr SSL_CONF_cmd 3
will be sent to
.Fa ctx .
.Pp
.Fn SSL_CONF_CTX_set_ssl
sets the context associated with
.Fa cctx
to the
.Vt SSL
structure
.Fa ssl .
Any previous
.Vt SSL
or
.Vt SSL_CTX
associated with
.Fa cctx
is cleared.
Subsequent calls to
.Xr SSL_CONF_cmd 3
will be sent to
.Fa ssl .
.Pp
The function
.Fn SSL_CONF_CTX_finish
must be called after all configuration operations have been completed.
It is used to finalise any operations or to process defaults.
.Sh NOTES
The context need not be set or it can be set to
.Dv NULL
in which case only syntax checking of commands is performed, where
possible.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn SSL_CONF_CTX_set_ssl_ctx
and
.Xr SSL_CTX_set_ssl 3
do not return a value.
.Pp
.Fn SSL_CONF_CTX_finish
returns 1 for success and 0 for failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ssl 7 ,
.Xr SSL_CONF_CTX_new 3 ,
.Xr SSL_CONF_CTX_set_flags 3 ,
.Xr SSL_CONF_CTX_set1_prefix 3 ,
.Xr SSL_CONF_cmd 3 ,
.Xr SSL_CONF_cmd_argv 3
.Sh HISTORY
These functions were added in OpenSSL 1.0.2.
